<title>USA: Specialty Chemical names president.</title>
<headline>Specialty Chemical names president.</headline>
<dateline>MACEDONIA, Ohio 1996-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Specialty Chemical Resources Inc said it has named Corey Roth as president and chief operating officer under a realignment of key management positions and responsibilities.</p>
<p>The company said the positions were previously held by Edwin Roth, who will remain chairman and chief executive.</p>
<p>Edwin Roth said the changes were intended to facilitate the company's continuing focus on identifying, acquiring and integrating additional operations into Specialty Chemical.</p>
<p>Corey Roth was previously vice president and treasurer.</p>
<p>The company also said it has named David Spink chief financial officer and treasurer of the company.</p>
